    "updated_at": "2017-03-20T10:23:38Z",
    "body": "More tests: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/5150.\r\n\r\nBugs filed thus far by @lyzadanger:\r\n* https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=169747 and https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=169748\r\n* https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=702178 and https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=702188\r\n\r\n@bzbarsky what do you think, should we just change this in Firefox to be case-sensitive?",
